      "readme": "This dataset contains the raw MRI data accompanying the paper \"China’s Social Fake News database release with brain structural, functional, and behavioural measures\". Please cite the above paper if you use this data.\r\n\r\nThe dataset includes:\r\n\r\n1. anat/ anatomical scans (T1-weighted images) for each subject\r\n2. func/ whole-brain EPI data from 2 task runs and 1 rest-state run per participant. \r\n\r\nThe events files contain the onsets, durations, trial types and response rating for all trials in the corresponding run. \r\n\r\n\r\nFor a full description of the paradigm and the employed procedures please see the paper.   ",
